      "content": "can you help me draft a formal request for diplomatic recognition? i want to send it to the UN and a few neighboring coastal states. i need it to sound like i'm not asking for permission, but rather just notifying them of my status so they can update their records. how should i phrase the part about my country's official seat in the international community?",
